  "description": "Supported Platforms:\n• NETStandard\n• NETFramework\n\n\nThe LEADTOOLS DICOMWeb SDK is a streamlined toolkit for developing applications that handle medical imaging data using the DICOMWeb standard. It supports key functions like querying (QIDO), storing (STOW), and retrieving (WADO) DICOM images, enabling the creation of efficient and compliant healthcare imaging applications.\n\nFor a list of packages that are configured with all of the required dependencies, please go to https://www.leadtools.com/downloads/nuget\n\nTo install the full LEADTOOLS Evaluation, please go to https://www.leadtools.com/downloads?category=main",
